# CafeMood Production Postgres initialization inputs
# Reference: docs/adr/0010-self-hosted-postgres-supabase-auth.md
#
# Consumed by the `db-prod` service only (docker-compose.prod.yml `env_file`).
# Never merge these keys into `.env.prod`: that file is passed wholesale to the
# web container, so a bootstrap credential there would be readable by the
# application process (BRAWUKA-1015).
#
# Required on first boot only: db-init/10-app-role.sh creates the non-superuser
# `coffeemode` role from APP_DB_PASSWORD. Later restarts reuse the volume.
# Keep APP_DB_PASSWORD equal to the password inside DATABASE_URL/DIRECT_URL.
POSTGRES_DB=coffeemode
POSTGRES_USER=postgres
POSTGRES_PASSWORD=CHANGE_ME_INITDB_SUPERUSER_PASSWORD
APP_DB_PASSWORD=CHANGE_ME_PROD_DB_PASSWORD
